flowchart TB
    subgraph DISCOVERY[部署发现]
      direction LR
      A[LiteLLM /model/info] --> B[按 model_name 聚合<br/>提取 model_info.id]
      B --> C[确定 Prometheus 模型名<br/>形成模型组—部署映射]
      M[接口不可用时<br/>显式配置降级] -.-> C
    end
    subgraph METRICS[指标聚合]
      direction LR
      D[Prometheus<br/>P 侧 running / waiting] --> E[按 cluster + instance 聚合]
      E --> F[外连接 running 与 waiting] --> G[按 cluster 汇总 inflight]
    end
    C --> H{deployment ID<br/>匹配 cluster label?}
    G --> H
    subgraph OUTPUT[写入与诊断]
      direction LR
      I[写入 Redis<br/>model_group : deployment_id : inflight] --> K[请求路由 MGET]
      J[漏刷清单 + 近似名称诊断] --> L[告警与配置修复]
    end
    H -->|匹配| I
    H -->|未匹配| J
